-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
iOS port
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This tree is an independent iOS port of the Android app, in Swift (Apache-2.0,
same license). It reuses no Android code or assets:

- SF Symbols (Apple system icon font) replace Material Symbols; SwiftUI and
  Charts replace Jetpack Compose.
- Navigation is in-app Apple Maps (MapKit) instead of reading a Google Maps
  notification, which iOS does not permit.
- Call and media features of the Android app are not ported: iOS provides no
  supported API for either.

The upstream Android project remains at
https://github.com/CODESURGEN/ruta under Apache-2.0.

